WEBVTT

00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:06.725
What?

00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:09.828
(sniffs)
Should it be smoking?

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.131
Yes, uh-huh.

00:00:11.231 --> 00:00:12.966
Smoking means it's working.

00:00:13.066 --> 00:00:15.035
(chuckles, gasps)

00:00:15.135 --> 00:00:16.568
(whimpers)

00:00:18.271 --> 00:00:20.173
- (screams)
- (flame whooshes)

00:00:20.273 --> 00:00:21.308
(electrical crackling)

00:00:21.408 --> 00:00:22.474
- (gasping)
- What's going on?

00:00:22.574 --> 00:00:24.710
Perfect. No one panic.

00:00:25.312 --> 00:00:26.913
Call 911!

00:00:27.013 --> 00:00:29.848
- (people screaming, sobbing)
- (fire alarm ringing)

00:00:32.118 --> 00:00:33.786
Quickly, quickly.

00:00:34.753 --> 00:00:36.156
- (fire truck horn blasting)
- Oh. (chuckles)

00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:37.856
Wonder where they're going.

00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:39.725
(frantic chatter)

00:00:40.492 --> 00:00:43.096
(laughs) Voilà.

00:00:43.196 --> 00:00:44.797
My latest creation.

00:00:44.897 --> 00:00:48.335
All of my transformation powers
in a handheld design, huh?

00:00:48.435 --> 00:00:49.835
Ay, I love it.

00:00:49.936 --> 00:00:51.972
Oh, and look at
the little antenna.

00:00:52.072 --> 00:00:52.871
That's so cute.

00:00:52.973 --> 00:00:54.941
It's not supposed
to be cute, no!

00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:57.944
I'm going for intimidating.
Terrifying, even.

00:00:58.044 --> 00:01:02.382
Now, all I have to do is find
that walking bald potato,

00:01:02.481 --> 00:01:04.650
- and his baby is mine.
- (laughing)

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.885
- Check this out. (chuckles)
- (alarm chirps)

00:01:06.987 --> 00:01:08.989
(whirring)

00:01:10.556 --> 00:01:12.258
(all gasping in awe)

00:01:12.359 --> 00:01:14.626
(barking)

00:01:15.594 --> 00:01:18.764
(laughing maniacally)

00:01:19.898 --> 00:01:23.269
No, I kid you not. I'm being...

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:24.870
Whoa!

00:01:25.904 --> 00:01:27.639
Whoa!

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.511
- (camera clicks)
- (rumbling)

00:01:39.551 --> 00:01:41.454
(Maxime laughing)

00:01:41.553 --> 00:01:44.556
Oh, this is going to be so good!

00:01:48.194 --> 00:01:50.662
(whooshing)

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:55.435
(groans)

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:59.172
Okay, Daddy is
officially exhausted.

00:01:59.272 --> 00:02:00.507
I changed your diaper.

00:02:00.606 --> 00:02:02.342
I've got your bottle,
your Binky.

00:02:02.442 --> 00:02:04.543
And here are your balloons.

00:02:04.643 --> 00:02:05.945
- There you go.
- (giggles)

00:02:06.046 --> 00:02:07.813
- You like those, right?
- (fussing)

00:02:07.914 --> 00:02:10.316
All right,
a little bit of me time.

00:02:10.417 --> 00:02:12.018
(sniffs deeply)

00:02:12.118 --> 00:02:13.685
(sighs)

00:02:14.421 --> 00:02:15.422
(grunts)

00:02:15.522 --> 00:02:16.555
(slurping)

00:02:16.655 --> 00:02:18.091
- (balloon pops)
- (screams)

00:02:19.159 --> 00:02:20.692
(groans)

00:02:21.394 --> 00:02:23.096
(Gru Jr. coos)

00:02:23.196 --> 00:02:24.730
(Gru grumbles)

00:02:30.403 --> 00:02:31.670
- Mmm, mmm.
- (balloon pops)

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:33.239
- (horn honks)
- (screams)

00:02:33.339 --> 00:02:35.108
(groans)

00:02:36.176 --> 00:02:37.609
(coos)

00:02:38.344 --> 00:02:40.013
(crying)

00:02:41.381 --> 00:02:43.615
(exasperated sigh)

00:02:43.715 --> 00:02:46.319
Someone put a glitter bomb
in my locker.

00:02:46.419 --> 00:02:49.055
Ugh, teenagers are the worst.

00:02:49.989 --> 00:02:53.259
Yeah, babies are no picnic, either.

00:02:53.359 --> 00:02:54.893
(Gru Jr. laughing)

00:02:58.164 --> 00:03:00.467
- (balloon pops)
- (horn honks, Gru screams)

00:03:00.567 --> 00:03:02.734
- GRU: Junior!
- (tires squealing)

00:03:05.572 --> 00:03:07.873
(snoring)

00:03:13.846 --> 00:03:15.681
(shushes, speaks Minionese)

00:03:15.781 --> 00:03:17.417
Ah, okay, okay.

00:03:17.517 --> 00:03:19.519
(grunting)

00:03:19.618 --> 00:03:21.387
Dua Lipa. Prosciutto.

00:03:21.488 --> 00:03:22.621
- (giggles)
- (grunts)

00:03:22.721 --> 00:03:25.058
- (yells)
- (laughing)

00:03:26.559 --> 00:03:28.528
(speaking Minionese)

00:03:28.627 --> 00:03:31.197
- Fire in de bowl!
- (explosive whoosh)

00:03:31.297 --> 00:03:32.565
(laughing)

00:03:32.664 --> 00:03:34.867
Good night, Ralph.

00:03:36.269 --> 00:03:37.836
(scatting)

00:03:37.937 --> 00:03:39.939
♪ Taking out the trash
'cause I'm an awesome dad ♪

00:03:40.039 --> 00:03:42.175
♪ And the baby finally
went to sleep. ♪

00:03:42.275 --> 00:03:44.643
(scatting)

00:03:45.912 --> 00:03:47.447
POPPY:
Hello, Gru.

00:03:47.547 --> 00:03:48.581
Hello. Wha... Hey.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.883
What. What the...

00:03:52.651 --> 00:03:54.354
Oh. Hello, Poppy.

00:03:54.454 --> 00:03:55.654
Did you say something?

00:03:55.754 --> 00:03:58.458
Wha... My name's Chet,
by the way.

00:03:58.558 --> 00:04:00.093
Chet Cunningham.

00:04:00.193 --> 00:04:01.161
Gru?

00:04:01.261 --> 00:04:04.063
(laughing): Wha...
What does that even mean?

00:04:06.698 --> 00:04:08.568
It means you're bad at lying.

00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:10.103
Hey, that's not nice.

00:04:10.203 --> 00:04:12.639
Ever hear of respecting
your elders?

00:04:12.738 --> 00:04:14.574
I don't respect boomers.

00:04:14.673 --> 00:04:16.176
I just mock them.

00:04:16.276 --> 00:04:17.210
(laughs)

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:20.413
Is that, like, a joke
you read on the Web?

00:04:20.513 --> 00:04:22.615
Wow. "The Web"?

00:04:22.714 --> 00:04:24.250
How old are you?

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:27.086
Well, old enough to know
that you are a rotten little...

00:04:27.187 --> 00:04:29.055
(gasps, stammers)

00:04:29.155 --> 00:04:31.524
- You better watch yourself.
- (yelps)

00:04:31.624 --> 00:04:32.959
(gasps) Ooh.

00:04:33.059 --> 00:04:35.595
You used to be a master villain.

00:04:35.694 --> 00:04:37.863
(scoffs)
That's not me.

00:04:37.964 --> 00:04:39.831
I don't even see a resemblance.

00:04:39.933 --> 00:04:42.569
Clearly, you have the wrong guy,

00:04:42.669 --> 00:04:45.771
as I sell... mm, solar panels.

00:04:45.871 --> 00:04:48.174
Oh, don't worry.
I'm not gonna expose you.

00:04:48.274 --> 00:04:50.543
Because you're gonna help me
pull a heist.

00:04:50.643 --> 00:04:52.412
We start planning tomorrow.

00:04:52.512 --> 00:04:54.147
You want to pull a heist?

00:04:54.247 --> 00:04:56.848
(laughs)
Listen, kid, I'm not going to...

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:59.385
- No, you listen, old man.
- Ow.

00:04:59.485 --> 00:05:01.187
I own you.

00:05:01.287 --> 00:05:05.658
And I promise,
you do not want to cross me.

00:05:05.757 --> 00:05:07.293
Okay. (stammers)

00:05:07.393 --> 00:05:11.264
All right, but tomorrow
is-is not really good timing.

00:05:11.364 --> 00:05:12.565
Bummer for you.

00:05:12.665 --> 00:05:14.534
Because this is happening,

00:05:14.634 --> 00:05:20.739
unless you want the whole world
to know exactly who you are...

00:05:23.243 --> 00:05:24.944
...Gru.

00:05:25.612 --> 00:05:26.745
(gasps)

00:05:26.845 --> 00:05:29.282
(whispers):
She's terrifying.

00:05:29.382 --> 00:05:30.984
(Minion humming)

00:05:31.084 --> 00:05:32.685
(grunts)

00:05:32.784 --> 00:05:34.187
Ah. (gasps)

00:05:34.287 --> 00:05:36.456
- Oh, looka! (speaks Minionese)
- (babbling)

00:05:36.556 --> 00:05:38.790
(laughter, whooping)

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.494
Bello. Bello. Thank you.

00:05:41.594 --> 00:05:43.429
(chatter in Minionese, laughter)

00:05:43.529 --> 00:05:44.896
- Ow!
- Ooh!

00:05:44.998 --> 00:05:46.733
(whooping laughter)

00:05:46.832 --> 00:05:48.468
(speaking excitedly
in Minionese)

00:05:48.568 --> 00:05:51.304
- (chuckles)
- (screams)

00:05:53.239 --> 00:05:54.741
- (speaks Minionese)
- Oh, thank you.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:56.276
- (camera clicks)
- (screams)

00:05:56.376 --> 00:05:57.076
(grunts)

00:05:57.176 --> 00:05:59.245
- (microwave timer dings)
- Yay!

00:05:59.345 --> 00:06:00.346
Oh, blumach.

00:06:00.446 --> 00:06:03.316
Hey, Jiminy! Tu cafe le colda?
No problemo.

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.718
(stammering, whimpering)

00:06:05.817 --> 00:06:07.220
(screaming)

00:06:11.823 --> 00:06:13.559
(people screaming)

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.361
(shouting frantically)

00:06:15.461 --> 00:06:16.629
(grunts)

00:06:16.729 --> 00:06:18.998
(sighs, speaks Minionese)

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:22.335
(laughing)

00:06:22.435 --> 00:06:24.270
(roaring)

00:06:25.772 --> 00:06:27.407
- Thank you.
- (yelps)

00:06:27.507 --> 00:06:29.242
(laughter)

00:06:29.342 --> 00:06:31.911
All right, all right,
s-settle down.

00:06:32.011 --> 00:06:33.746
- Settle down!
- (laughter dies down)

00:06:33.845 --> 00:06:35.281
Thank you.

00:06:35.381 --> 00:06:37.617
It's time to get you out
for some real-world training.

00:06:37.717 --> 00:06:39.752
(excited chatter)

00:06:39.851 --> 00:06:42.155
And if you do well out there,

00:06:42.255 --> 00:06:45.591
you'll be the AVL's
new secret weapon.

00:06:45.692 --> 00:06:46.892
Pomodoro!

00:06:46.993 --> 00:06:48.027
(others murmuring)

00:06:48.127 --> 00:06:50.363
(all shouting in Minionese)

00:06:50.463 --> 00:06:51.497
(laughter)

00:06:51.597 --> 00:06:53.466
(grunts, chatters)

00:06:53.566 --> 00:06:55.401
- (laughs)
- (cheering)

00:06:55.501 --> 00:06:57.603
(startled grunting)

00:06:58.237 --> 00:07:01.374
I'm quite sure
I won't regret this.

